-> evidence.** So the cumulative base is **computed at runtime, not authored**, and this contract
-> described a derived value as if it were a field of the authored data. **What the sum IS, and when
-> it is filled, is not established here** — the rebase pass is the obvious candidate and naming it
-> would be a guess.
